# Raw asset downloads for the scene dressing.
#
# `scripts/fetch-assets.mjs` pulls Poly Haven's film-quality source — 177 MB of
# it — and `scripts/optimize-assets.mjs` decimates and Meshopt-encodes that into
# `public/models/dressing/*.glb`, which is what ships and what is committed. Both
# steps are reproducible, so the source has no business in the history: keeping
# it would multiply the repository by twelve to store geometry no frame draws.
#
# The five models below this block predate the optimiser and are still committed
# raw. They are small, and re-cutting their load paths would be churn for no
# payload win.
public/models/coast_rocks_01/
public/models/coast_rocks_03/
public/models/coastal_cliff_02/
public/models/sand_rocks_small_01/
